Tuxemon means several different things:

* The [[Tuxemon project]] is the collaboration of many people around the world to design monsters, techniques, stories, maps, items, and all sorts of other things that belong in the monster catching genre. 
* ''[[Tuxemon (game)|Tuxemon]]'' is the name of the first game that the Tuxemon project is creating
* Tuxemon are the [[creatures]]/monsters that we design.